<div class="py-8"><h1 class="font-display text-2xl mb-2">Approved records</h1><p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">Status compares each approved record with the published set as of the last start. Whether its pull request is open, merged or closed is read on GitHub through the link.</p><div class="data-table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Approved records" tabindex="0"><table class="data-table"><caption class="sr-only">Approved records</caption><thead><tr><th class="data-table-head-cell" scope="col">Shortcode</th><th class="data-table-head-cell" scope="col">Project</th><th class="data-table-head-cell" scope="col">Approved</th><th class="data-table-head-cell" scope="col">Status</th><th class="data-table-head-cell" scope="col"><span class="sr-only">Actions</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="font-mono text-sm">0801</span></td><td class="data-table-cell">Bernoulli-Euler Online</td><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="text-sm">2026-09-01 08:00 UTC</span></td><td class="data-table-cell"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="badge badge-success badge-md">Published</span><p class="text-sm"><a href="https://github.com/dasch-swiss/dsp-repository/pulls?q=is%3Apr+head%3Aeditor%2F0801" class="link " aria-label="Pull requests on GitHub for 0801">Pull requests on GitHub</a></p></div></td><td class="data-table-cell"><a href="/approved/1/discard" class="link " aria-label="Discard the approved record for 0801">Discard</a></td></tr><tr><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="font-mono text-sm">0802</span></td><td class="data-table-cell">Bernoulli-Euler Online</td><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="text-sm">2026-09-01 08:00 UTC</span></td><td class="data-table-cell"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="badge badge-info badge-md">Waiting for release</span><p class="text-sm text-neutral-600">Differs in: name, abstract.</p><p class="text-sm"><a href="https://github.com/dasch-swiss/dsp-repository/pulls?q=is%3Apr+head%3Aeditor%2F0802" class="link " aria-label="Pull requests on GitHub for 0802">Pull requests on GitHub</a></p></div></td><td class="data-table-cell"><a href="/approved/2/discard" class="link " aria-label="Discard the approved record for 0802">Discard</a></td></tr><tr><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="font-mono text-sm">0803</span></td><td class="data-table-cell">Bernoulli-Euler Online</td><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="text-sm">2026-09-01 08:00 UTC</span></td><td class="data-table-cell"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="badge badge-warning badge-md">Project dropped upstream</span><p class="text-sm"><a href="https://github.com/dasch-swiss/dsp-repository/pulls?q=is%3Apr+head%3Aeditor%2F0803" class="link " aria-label="Pull requests on GitHub for 0803">Pull requests on GitHub</a></p></div></td><td class="data-table-cell"><a href="/approved/3/discard" class="link " aria-label="Discard the approved record for 0803">Discard</a></td></tr><tr><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="font-mono text-sm">0804</span></td><td class="data-table-cell">Bernoulli-Euler Online</td><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="text-sm">2026-09-01 08:00 UTC</span></td><td class="data-table-cell"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="badge badge-danger badge-md">Payload unreadable</span><p class="text-sm text-neutral-600">Reason: invalid type: string, expected map</p><p class="text-sm"><a href="https://github.com/dasch-swiss/dsp-repository/pulls?q=is%3Apr+head%3Aeditor%2F0804" class="link " aria-label="Pull requests on GitHub for 0804">Pull requests on GitHub</a></p></div></td><td class="data-table-cell"><a href="/approved/4/discard" class="link " aria-label="Discard the approved record for 0804">Discard</a></td></tr><tr><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="font-mono text-sm">0805</span></td><td class="data-table-cell">Bernoulli-Euler Online</td><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="text-sm">2026-09-01 08:00 UTC</span></td><td class="data-table-cell"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="badge badge-danger badge-md">Unexpected comparison</span><p class="text-sm"><a href="https://github.com/dasch-swiss/dsp-repository/pulls?q=is%3Apr+head%3Aeditor%2F0805" class="link " aria-label="Pull requests on GitHub for 0805">Pull requests on GitHub</a></p></div></td><td class="data-table-cell"><a href="/approved/5/discard" class="link " aria-label="Discard the approved record for 0805">Discard</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
